        "question": "What should you ask before a talking toy comes home?",
        "text": "Ask who hears your child's voice, where it goes, how long it is kept and how you delete it.[^1] Ask what the toy does when it is unsure, and whether you can read every conversation. A company with nothing to hide answers each question plainly and in writing."
